        "checksum": "b69cc03eeaa512fb765ef86ffb4055eb8af497c531de8ca2efc92d1a421e49f8_1_1_0_0__1",
        "gg7LKEScnb5_text": "<p>We believe in saving you extra hassle. That’s why any purchase of two bottles or more receives <strong>free shipping</strong>—because you shouldn’t have to pay hidden fees to reclaim your comfort and confidence. The more you buy, the more you save!</p>",
        "ggDTvwsGblJ_text": "<p>Some feel relief faster, and some take a bit longer—everyone’s different. If you don’t feel happier, calmer, or see visible results during your first 90 days, just let us know and we’ll process your <strong>instant refund</strong> with no questions asked.</p>",
