        "ggVLtvnyqnJ_text": "<p>Our trusted payment processors:</p>",
        "ggYb0inIJ2Z_text": "<p>Most women notice improvements within 14 days</p>",
        "gg_YbDO0x2S_text": "Your Purchase Is Protected By Our <span style=\"color:#EE2E8D;\">90-Day 100% Money-Back Guarantee</span>",
        "ggclFXSZPQp_text": "<p>Free Shipping On 2 &amp; 4 Bottle Orders (Within The U.S.)</p>",
        "ggdeY2Jf9RP_text": "<p>Here at Wellness Nest, we want you to feel absolutely confident trying our product—or we’ll refund 100% of your investment. We’re so certain you’ll see a real change in your menopause symptoms, hot flashes, mood, and weight management that we bear all the risk.</p>",
        "ggpeDnoItsf_text": "<p>We use a <strong>256-bit secure checkout </strong>your data is encrypted, safe, and secure.</p>",
        "ggt5kw7aViW_text": "<p>With <strong>up to three full months</strong> to experience MenoMate, you’ll have plenty of time to see real improvements—from fewer hot flashes and better sleep to a flatter midsection. If you’re not completely satisfied, just reach out for a<strong> fast, no-questions-asked refund</strong>. We want your only surprise to be how quickly you feel like yourself again.</p>"
      },
