    "gp_section_573918798240613145": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "ce7bb901ad4d404d50f04e98fed0c16e9e12fc45c44ca4d2bfec2f4b95ef6f77_1_1_0_0__1",
        "gDXpeJySIegHq_text": "<p>Still Not Sure?</p>",
        "geznomfYacPon_text": "<p><strong>Still have questions?</strong></p>",
        "gg1LLfWGFbH_text": "<p>Nope! Our vitamins are all-natural, made with vegan, non-GMO, and gluten-free ingredients.</p>",
        "gg3In78yG5O_text": "<p><i>90-Day Money-back Guarantee</i></p>",
        "gg3O1d12p5q_text": "<p>FloraFresh is ideal for <strong>women ages 20 and up</strong> who want to maintain a <strong>healthy vaginal microbiome</strong>. It’s especially beneficial for those prone to <strong>imbalance, odor concerns, or discomfort due to pH shifts</strong>.</p>",
        "gg5r5suHM2c_childItem_0": "<p>Product</p>",
        "gg5r5suHM2c_childItem_1": "<p>Shipping</p>",
        "gg5r5suHM2c_childItem_2": "<p>Others</p>",
        "gg5r5suHM2c_childItem_3": "<p>Reference</p>",
        "gg61CD1i7Kc_text": "<p>Warning: Don’t bother hauling extra menstrual pads to work! FloraFresh might hit you with a hydration wave so wild you’ll think you’re Niagara Falls down there—but relax, it’s just our probiotics and Vitamin C turning your dusty, stinky woes into a hot, fresh splash party!</p>",
        "gg8VFpLp-___text": "<p>Yes, all credit card transactions are securely processed through Shopify, PayPal, or Amazon.</p>",
        "ggAf5i_TgPF_text": "<p>A synbiotic combines both <strong>probiotics (beneficial bacteria)</strong> and <strong>prebiotics (nutrients that help probiotics thrive)</strong> to maximize their effectiveness. FloraFresh’s <strong>probiotic blend (15 Billion CFUs)</strong> works in harmony with XOS prebiotics to create a supportive environment for vaginal wellness.</p>",
        "ggEiHFSjSkO_label": "<p>Try FloralFresh Now!</p>",
        "ggINUbt-0mq_text": "<p>Contact our support team at</p>",
        "ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_0": "<p>What are vaginal prebiotics + probiotics?</p>",
        "ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_1": "<p>How does FloraFresh work?</p>",
        "ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_10": "<p>What are the key ingredients in FloraFresh?</p>",
        "ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_2": "<p>What is a synbiotic?</p>",
        "ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_3": "<p>Can I take FloraFresh with other supplements?</p>",
        "ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_4": "<p>Who should take FloraFresh?</p>",
        "ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_5": "<p>How do I take FloraFresh?</p>",
        "ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_6": "<p>Can FloraFresh be taken with prescription medications?</p>",
        "ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_7": "<p>Are there any side effects I should be concerned about with FloraFresh?</p>",
        "ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_8": "<p>How long does it take for FloraFresh to work?</p>",
        "ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_9": "<p>Can vaginal probiotics affect my menstrual cycle?</p>",
        "ggOoj1p_I0j_text": "<p>Each serving (2 capsules) contains:</p><ul><li><strong>Vitamin C (as Ascorbic Acid) – 40mg</strong> (44% DV)</li><li><strong>FloraFresh Probiotic Blend – 54mg</strong> (15 Billion CFUs of Lactobacillus strains)</li><li><strong>Xylooligosaccharides (Prebiotic XOS) – 50mg</strong></li><li><strong>D-Mannose – 50mg</strong></li><li><strong>(Capsules are free from artificial additives, gluten, dairy, and GMOs.)</strong></li></ul>",
        "ggR5-TNGLAP_text": "<p>No worries! Email us at support@wellnessnest.co, and we’ll sort it out for you.</p>",
        "ggUZFDBANHF_text": "<p>If you are taking prescription medications or have a medical condition, it's best to <strong>consult your healthcare provider</strong> before starting any new supplement. Do not use if the safety seal is broken or missing.</p>",
        "ggWKzj3mZYo_text": "<p>Many users notice improvements within 7-14 days, with full benefits after 8 weeks of consistent use. Individual results may vary, but we're confident you'll see positive changes</p>",
        "ggXNgRoGZ7a_text": "<p>We offer shipping worldwide!<br>&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggYCBVBXnrj_childItem_0": "<p>Is my credit card information secure?</p>",
        "ggYCBVBXnrj_childItem_1": "<p>Where do you ship?</p>",
        "ggYCBVBXnrj_childItem_2": "<p>How much does shipping cost?</p>",
        "ggYCBVBXnrj_childItem_3": "<p>How do I track my package?</p>",
        "ggYCBVBXnrj_childItem_4": "<p>I didn’t receive a shipping or order confirmation. Help!</p>",
        "ggZniogzhxv_text": "<p>Want to know if your vitamins are on their way? Tracking information should have been sent to you via email when you placed your order. If you didn’t receive it, send us an email at support@wellnessnest.co.</p>",
        "ggaIXTmsXZA_text": "<p>Yes! FloraFresh is designed to complement other wellness supplements. It pairs well with urinary tract support formulas, PMS relief supplements, and general gut health probiotics. However, if you are taking multiple probiotic formulas, consider spacing them throughout the day for best results.</p>",
        "ggchKAmY9Py_text": "<p>FloraFresh works by replenishing beneficial bacteria in the vaginal ecosystem, helping to crowd out non-beneficial microbes and support a healthy balance. The probiotic strains in FloraFresh—<strong>Lactobacillus salivarius, Lactobacillus rhamnosus, Lactobacillus reuteri, and Lactobacillus gasseri</strong>—have been selected for their ability to promote vaginal health, while <strong>Xylooligosaccharides (Prebiotic XOS) and D-Mannose</strong> provide additional support.</p>",
        "gghcyelJxPO_text": "<p>By law, the FDA does not approve dietary supplements. However, it does regulate both dietary supplements and their ingredients. At Wellness Nest, we comply with the FDA’s “Current Good Manufacturing Practice” (cGMP) regulations, established in 2007. These require manufacturers to evaluate products for identity, purity, strength, and composition. We go further by testing for stability with our manufacturers and conducting third-party testing for potency of active ingredients, as well as screening for adulterants like heavy metals and microbes, allergens, rancidity, and other unwanted contaminants.</p>",
        "gghzAEIneIS_text": "<p>FloraFresh is a carefully formulated vaginal prebiotic + probiotic supplement designed to support a balanced vaginal microbiome. It contains a synergistic blend of probiotics and prebiotics to maintain optimal vaginal pH, promote healthy flora, and help manage unwanted dryness and odors naturally.</p>",
        "ggi2qbtFyBl_text": "<p>Take <strong>2 capsules per day</strong>, preferably with food, or as directed by your healthcare provider. For best results, make FloraFresh part of your <strong>daily wellness routine</strong>.</p>",
        "ggih2t7nP_S_childItem_0": "<p>Are Wellness Nest supplements FDA-approved?</p>",
        "ggih2t7nP_S_childItem_1": "<p>Are there any artificial flavors, colors, or dyes in Wellness Nest supplements?</p>",
        "ggih2t7nP_S_childItem_2": "<p>Where are Wellness Nest supplements manufactured?</p>",
        "ggjapvgxD2E_text": "<p>Probiotics do not directly alter menstrual cycles, but lifestyle factors, stress, and diet can contribute to cycle changes. If you experience any unusual shifts, consult your healthcare provider.</p>",
        "ggmq_rxa5Z0_text": "<p>support@wellnessnest.co</p>",
        "ggsXWr7i8ur_text": "<p>Wellness Nest supplements are formulated, manufactured, and packaged with care right here in the USA. That said, some of our products may occasionally be backstocked from third-party manufacturers partnering with our main supplier, based in India, China, or Vietnam.</p>",
        "ggujEU4nA-I_text": "<p><strong>1. Johns Hopkins Medicine</strong>: https://www.hopkinsmedicine.org/health/wellness-and-prevention/turmeric-benefits</p><p><strong>2. Idyl</strong>: https://www.idyl.co.in/blogs/blog/unlock-the-heart-healthy-secrets-of-curry-leaves</p><p><strong>3. Journal of Midwifery &amp; Women's Health</strong>: https://journals.lww.com/jomh/fulltext/2024/15010/exploring_the_efficacy_and_safety_of_black_cohosh.3.aspx</p><p><strong>4. PMC</strong>: https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9881416/</p><p><strong>5. PubMed</strong>: https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/16552838/</p><p><strong>6. Medical News Today</strong>: https://www.medicalnewstoday.com/articles/317530</p><p><strong>7. Harvard Health Publishing</strong>: https://www.health.harvard.edu/staying-healthy/turmeric-benefits-a-look-at-the-evidence</p><p><strong>8. NDTV</strong>: https://www.ndtv.com/food/diabetes-how-curry-leaves-kadi-patta-help-manage-blood-sugar-levels-1949847</p><p><strong>9. NIH</strong>: https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/BlackCohosh-HealthProfessional/</p><p><strong>10. WebMD</strong>: https://www.webmd.com/vitamins/ai/ingredientmono-662/turmeric</p><p><strong>11. Healthline</strong>: https://www.healthline.com/nutrition/curry-leaves-benefits</p><p><strong>12. Mount Sinai</strong>: https://www.mountsinai.org/health-library/herb/black-cohosh</p><p><strong>13. Mayo Clinic</strong>: https://newsnetwork.mayoclinic.org/discussion/mayo-clinic-minute-are-there-health-benefits-to-taking-turmeric/</p><p><strong>14. Healthline</strong>: https://www.healthline.com/nutrition/top-10-evidence-based-health-benefits-of-turmeric</p>",
        "ggvnZqhBKwk_text": "<p>or check out our <strong>Help Center</strong> for more details&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggxwe77QI9n_text": "<p>Shipping is free for bundle of 60 days and 120 days!</p>",
        "gumjwRkQTLmeE_text": "Here Are The Top Questions We Get About <span style=\"color:#D76C95;\">FloralFresh</span>"
      },
