        "ggGjUiqBsk8_text": "<p>I've struggled with embarrassing BV for years, trying diets, antibiotics, and more, but nothing worked until I found this probiotic. After just a week, the odor improved significantly, and now it’s almost gone. I still deal with UTIs, but this has been a game-changer for my BV. If you’ve battled BV like me, try this—you won’t regret it!</p>",
