        "gg7ZWZAegfm_text": "Why Do <span style=\"color:#EE2E8D;\">50,000+ Women Choose FloraFresh</span> Over Other Vaginal Health Supplements?",
        "ggBZi9HVN_Q_text": "<p>Enhances Vaginal Moisture</p>",
        "ggLM5q064zl_text": "FloraFresh vs. Other Solutions:",
        "ggN4Jb27coM_text": "<p>90-Day Money-Back Guarantee</p>",
        "ggOYYpERQjj_text": "<p>Supports Healthy Vaginal Flora &amp; pH</p>",
        "ggUndel0Um2_text": "<p>Multi-Action Formula for Total Care</p>",
        "ggUuLcyOOR2_text": "<p>Vaginal Moisturizers</p>",
        "ggYodXYj9Ne_text": "<p>Hydrating Ingredients for Everyday Comfort</p>",
        "ggpBl6eb7mK_text": "<p>FloraFresh does what others can’t—<span style=\"color:#EE2E8D;\"><strong>nourishing, restoring, and protecting</strong></span> your intimate health naturally!</p>",
