    "gp_section_573918798240940825": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "342503e729106d35dbb93d12c9628489f4eb4cca8b5d049da7849ae4be85a14d_1_1_0_0__1",
        "gPigudNTApaQS_text": "<p>Here’s Your Effortless Solution to <span style=\"color:#EE2E8D;\">Strengthen Vaginal Flora, Stop Stubborn Infections</span>, and <span style=\"color:#EE2E8D;\">Banish Odor &amp; Discharge</span> for Good!</p>",
        "gQSbvfrWxyTRn_text": "<p>But here’s the good news!</p>",
        "gg3aDG1FKDA_text": "<p>FloraFresh packs three powerhouse probiotics (Lactobacillus salivarius, rhamnosus, reuteri, gasseri), Prebiotic XOS, and D-Mannose to balance your vaginal flora, cutting down infections, smells, and discharge. Plus, it’s loaded with vitamin support for inflammation and collagen to hydrate and heal your skin.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#CB7B04;\"><strong>The reward?&nbsp;</strong></span><br>Rock-solid confidence in every moment thanks to:</p>",
        "gg7L7c8aHji_text": "<p>Boosted natural lubrication for carefree intimacy</p>",
        "ggVKIgr6WwM_text": "<p>💧</p>",
        "ggXfEjGaFw9_text": "<p>🔥</p>",
        "ggY7c90p_Kv_text": "<p>🌸</p>",
        "ggbdd1kkmb3_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:px;\">In a survey of our initial customers, 91% reported significantly reduced vaginal dryness, improved comfort during intimacy, and relief from persistent irritation within the first 4 weeks.</span></p>",
        "ggbiH51wuNY_text": "<p>Less frequent yeast infections, BV, and UTIs</p>",
