        "gghUr701IDZ_text": "<p>90-Day Money-back Guarantee</p>",
        "ggmVJfhZhhg_text": "<p>Minimal irritation, odor, and discharge (and less cash wasted on meds)</p>",
        "ggoKwn5DDT__text": "<p>Smooth, hydrated skin, especially down there</p>",
        "ggpx54hbuDa_text": "<p>All without harsh chemicals, synthetic fragrances, or artificial hormones—just natural, clinically-validated ingredients that replenish and maintain your body's natural moisture balance.</p>",
        "ggw9tC3HKrR_text": "<p>90-Day Money-back Guarantee</p>",
        "gqkWtmqeEUwsT_text": "<p>Say hello to <span style=\"color:#921070;\"><strong>FloraFresh - the exclusive probiotic &amp; prebiotic formula</strong></span> engineered to reclaim your intimate health and boldness.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This revolutionary, multi-benefit mix isn’t just another vaginal probiotic.</p>"
