        "gYKhuBtxFbGgc_text": "<p><u>Without</u> uncomfortable creams or prescriptions.</p>",
        "gaGcIecDtdtzx_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#EE2E8D;\"><strong>FloraFresh</strong></span> <strong>contains 4 powerful probiotic strains, prebiotics, and essential nutrients </strong>meticulously selected by leading women's health and probiotic experts. Every ingredient is backed by extensive research, numerous studies, and perfectly measured in precise scientific dosages to eliminate vaginal dryness, soothe irritation, and maintain optimal vaginal health...</p>",
        "gcUJtTYRUzCTz_text": "<p>Enhances immune function and strengthens vaginal tissue by promoting collagen production for improved moisture and elasticity.&nbsp;<br>[4, 5, 13]</p>",
        "ggTno9YwrbB_label": "<p>Try FloraFresh Now!</p>",
        "ggVRcwfpJhe_text": "<p>90-Day Money-back Guarantee</p>",
        "ggt1Y1wOTCq_text": "<p>D-Mannose</p>",
        "ggwGFnaUitU_text": "<p>Supports urinary tract health by preventing harmful bacteria from attaching to bladder walls, reducing urinary discomfort, frequency, and irritation.&nbsp;<br>[10, 11, 12]</p>",
        "guWDNgLGfqtcY_text": "<p>FloraFresh Probiotic Blend</p>",
        "gutRBpVZekmCl_text": "<p>Nourishes beneficial bacteria in your vagina, reinforcing natural defenses against infections, irritation, and imbalance.&nbsp;<br>[9, 10]</p>"
      },
