        "ggkgTh2i2hx_text": "Verified buyer",
        "ggn7R_aZBSM_text": "<p>Rachel C.</p>",
        "ggpB3NPleQ__text": "<p><strong>The result?</strong> A frustrating cycle of bacterial vaginosis, yeast infections, and UTIs that keep returning no matter what you try. The itching, discharge, and embarrassing odor aren't just uncomfortable - they signal your body's natural defenses have been compromised.</p>",
